{"detail": {"templateUuid": "c4f406917a924f55ba5dbb6129c23843", "projectUuid": "1b552b5f159a4d2c8071d3a49663dd03", "name": "《山城状元令》 高德扫街榜TVC 重庆文旅宣传片", "description": "《山城状元令》是一部以重庆为舞台的AI城市文旅概念短片，以“高德扫街榜”为叙事线索，跟随高小德的视角，开启一场穿越山城时空的“必吃、必游”巡礼。\n\n短片以重庆独特的立体地形为画布，用东方赛博的视觉语言，勾勒出轻轨穿楼、索道越江、立交盘旋的魔幻图景；又以巴渝烟火的生活温度，捕捉火锅沸腾、小面翻滚、夜市喧闹的人间滋味。\n\n从黎明蓝调到夜晚鎏金，从写实街巷到赛博幻想，全片在120秒内完成一次对重庆的深情扫描——既是一座城的立体肖像，也是一次关于“值得去”的真实作答。", "coverUrl": "/assets/d23eb3d232b176a4.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/2030962eb25f4b20bcad476f44be9314/1448f056a2be0bef259efb527866177e57fc1e50.mp4", "snapshotId": 30900, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 8989122, "ownerUuid": "2030962eb25f4b20bcad476f44be9314", "avatar": "/assets/652dadf94249a8a6.webp", "nickname": "木有木", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 32, "tags": [{"id": 3045, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "走，我们扫街去", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3045/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3047, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-城市状元", "parentTag": 3045, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3045/3047", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1205, "code": "culture_tourism", "tagLabel": "文旅政媒", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1205/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 5, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://v.douyin.com/qEMolZENx6Y/ 、https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a663f97000000001c012d7e?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABsICCZjjdmhgRYpcZycctOiln5ogC0VyCLI8UxAr5h38=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2